        {"zh": "袍角先落在地上", "en": "My hem settles to the ground first."},
        {"zh": "这是针叶林，很密", "en": "This is a conifer wood, dense."},
        {"zh": "我打开了第一页", "en": "I open the first page."},
        {"zh": "我合上书，站在树影下。", "en": "I close the book and stand in the tree shadow."},
        {"zh": "我先记下这些树", "en": "First I record these trees."},
        {"zh": "它们比我想的更老", "en": "They're older than I expected."},
        {"zh": "我慢慢地飘起来", "en": "I rise slowly."},
        {"zh": "有活物在林子里", "en": "There are living things in this wood."},
        {"zh": "我先不去惊动", "en": "I won't disturb them yet."},
        {"zh": "我的任务是植树", "en": "My task is to plant trees."},
        {"zh": "但现在我得先找到主人", "en": "But first I must find my master."}
